Core/Jessie: You really think we can make this work? Meeting up?
Core/Rose: I don’t know. But I’d rather try and fail than spend the rest of however long I have left talking to myself.
Core/Jessie: Fair enough.
Core/Rose: Besides… you seem capable. Reckless, maybe. But capable.
Core/Jessie: I’ll take that as a compliment.
Core/Rose: It was one.